        "original_id": "23463a71-6f0e-538d-bb24-886d0a10f8fd",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Thomas D. Howie\n- Events: Operation Overlord, Operation Neptune, D-Day, Battle of Normandy, World War II\n- Places: Saint-Lô, Normandy\n\nFacts:\n- Thomas D. Howie was born on April 12, 1908.\n- Operation Overlord was launched on June 6, 1944, with the Normandy landings called Operation Neptune, commonly known as D-Day.\n- Thomas D. Howie was an American army officer.\n- Thomas D. Howie was killed on July 17, 1944, during the Battle of Normandy in World War II while trying to capture the French town of Saint-Lô.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
